# Unreal Engine 生成目录
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/

# IDE 与本机缓存
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.VC.db
*.sln
*.suo
*.opensdf
*.sdf

# 本机打包和临时导出
Build/Receipts/
Build/Windows/FileOpenOrder/
Build/Android/src/
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak

# .NET 大厅服务生成目录
**/bin/
**/obj/
*.user
TestResults/
**/node_modules/
**/.angular/
**/dist/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Admin Web 的发布目录只能由 Angular 源码生成；保留占位文件满足 ASP.NET 静态资产启动约束。
/Services/GuiyangMahjong.Admin/wwwroot/*
!/Services/GuiyangMahjong.Admin/wwwroot/.gitkeep

# Workflow C 的 publish 内容是可重复生成的验证产物；长期证据另存 Evidence 或明确的监控证据目录。
/Artifacts/WorkflowC/
Deploy/.env
Deploy/linux/.env
Deploy/observability/.env
Deploy/linux/backups/
Deploy/linux/diagnostics/
Deploy/linux/.deployed-version
Deploy/linux/.previous-version
Artifacts/LinuxServer/*
!Artifacts/LinuxServer/.gitkeep
